553
00:45:29,944 --> 00:45:32,817
That's the room.

554
00:45:32,860 --> 00:45:35,515
Show us. Tell us about the room.

555
00:45:36,646 --> 00:45:39,258
That's the room where the Shepherd

556
00:45:39,301 --> 00:45:42,435
